# =============================================================
# Nikon COOLPIX research repository - .gitignore
# Multi-model layout: models/p500, models/p510, models/p520, common/
# Firmware and proprietary material is NEVER committed. Keep hash
# records and notes instead.
# =============================================================

# Secrets, credentials, and local environment files.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/secrets/
**/credentials/
**/*credentials*
**/*secret*
**/*cookie*
**/*session-token*
**/*auth-token*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.kdbx
**/.ssh/
**/.aws/credentials
**/.config/gh/hosts.yml
**/.git-credentials
**/.netrc
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
*.rdp
*.rdg
*.crd

# Local backups and firmware images/derivatives. Keep hash records and notes.
# Local firmware layout (same for every model):
#   firmware/original/<MODEL>/    untouched originals
#   firmware/reference/<MODEL>/   reference samples
#   firmware/extracted/<MODEL>/   extracted payloads
#   firmware/modified/<MODEL>/    derived or changed files
/backups/**
/firmware/original/**
/firmware/reference/**
/firmware/extracted/**
/firmware/modified/**
# Catch-all so any new firmware subfolder is covered automatically.
/firmware/**
# Only the layout note may be committed from the firmware folder.
!/firmware/README.md

# Binary, image, and compiled file types (firmware and derivatives).
*.bin
*.rom
*.fw
*.firmware
*.img
*.iso
*.pdf
*.elf
*.hex
*.ihex
*.mot
*.srec
*.s19
*.dfu
*.upd
*.pkg
*.dump
*.dmp
*.core
*.mem
*.memory
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.class

# Exception: the 293-byte P510 DeviceInfo response is owner-captured
# research data. NOTE: it contains the camera's device serial field.
# Remove this exception line if you decide to take the file out of the repo.
!/models/p510/analysis/P510-GetDeviceInfo.raw.bin

# Proprietary Nikon media/installers and first-level installer extraction.
**/reference-media/original/**
**/reference-media/software/**
**/NX-Studio/extracted/**

# Third-party board photographs and archived web-page bodies.
**/phase4d-board-images/**
**/phase4e-board-images/**
**/phase4b-web-captures/**

# Local build outputs and generated/cache state.
/build/
/dist/
/out/
/target/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.lock
*.save
*.tcd
*.prp
*.gbf
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/

# Ghidra databases and machine-local runtime/cache state.
# (Text logs in ghidra-logs/ are intentionally kept in Git.)
**/ghidra-projects/
**/ghidra-cache/
**/ghidra-temp/
**/ghidra-user-state/
**/.ghidra/
